      "derivation": "Direct shift phase. At phase start [2,2] holds diamond-right, which proposes [2,3]. [2,3] is empty, in bounds, not blocked, and only one piece claims it, so diamond-right moves. Its source index is 2*5+2=12. Circle-right at [2,1] proposes [2,2]. That cell was occupied when the phase began, so it is unavailable even though the occupant is leaving. Circle-right stays at [2,1]. After the shift, [2,2] is empty and diamond-right is at [2,3]."
